    "reason": "The only evidence is a one-line changelog enhancement entry [ev-f7d3abb12e99] saying that metrics now support the gRPC and gRPC-Web protocols. It does not say that metrics endpoints accept gRPC requests, so the proposed statement misreads it. It also does not say whether anything changes for existing environments, such as new or different protocol label values on recorded metrics. Deciding between behavior-change and none needs the PR #9483 description or a migration/metrics documentation note showing what changes in emitted metrics after upgrade.",
